{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Wild Baffo",
    "steam_appid": 1394880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/4893378bab9f0ea1c78a364912837512.avif?t=1738157526\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the bizarre world of Baffoland, a man's moustache is his power. But yours has been stolen - on the eve of the biggest day of yoru life! Fight through hordes of enemies and numerous bosses in five different scenarios in your quest to reclaim your beloved facial hair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/a7e678f7ff5086097e6c737068705905.webp?t=1738157526\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/cbd06825ae980847bc88b9b2657f6a86.avif?t=1738157526\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay is faithful to the vintage light-gun arcade classics. With full controller, touch, and light gun compatibility, you can play the game in whatever way best suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/1cea383520872ccccb2883d25220ffaf.poster.avif?t=1738157526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/1cea383520872ccccb2883d25220ffaf.webm?t=1738157526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/1cea383520872ccccb2883d25220ffaf.mp4?t=1738157526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/a7e678f7ff5086097e6c737068705905.webp?t=1738157526\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/717fcc4e020637efe196d385706d37f2.avif?t=1738157526\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who stole your moustache and why do they want it so bad? Get to the bottom of a mystery that goes far deeper than it seems at first glance. What started as a normal day will end up changing Baffoland forever\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/ed5e6f0006f7b6b0b242d8b6af2e5191.poster.avif?t=1738157526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/ed5e6f0006f7b6b0b242d8b6af2e5191.webm?t=1738157526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/ed5e6f0006f7b6b0b242d8b6af2e5191.mp4?t=1738157526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/a7e678f7ff5086097e6c737068705905.webp?t=1738157526\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/2017b085f5cf8921922be3a1ded98632.avif?t=1738157526\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete against yourself and others on the leaderboard to get the best time and score in the whole world. Can you get 100% accuracy, and complete the game in the quickest time possible to get maximum points?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/5092cde228b6f144b1170b6a44f8baff.poster.avif?t=1738157526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/5092cde228b6f144b1170b6a44f8baff.webm?t=1738157526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/5092cde228b6f144b1170b6a44f8baff.mp4?t=1738157526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/a7e678f7ff5086097e6c737068705905.webp?t=1738157526\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/fc3f6d7ef68d1fbd26196bb21e3d9a12.webp?t=1738157526\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/4893378bab9f0ea1c78a364912837512.avif?t=1738157526\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the bizarre world of Baffoland, a man's moustache is his power. But yours has been stolen - on the eve of the biggest day of yoru life! Fight through hordes of enemies and numerous bosses in five different scenarios in your quest to reclaim your beloved facial hair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/a7e678f7ff5086097e6c737068705905.webp?t=1738157526\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/cbd06825ae980847bc88b9b2657f6a86.avif?t=1738157526\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay is faithful to the vintage light-gun arcade classics. With full controller, touch, and light gun compatibility, you can play the game in whatever way best suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/1cea383520872ccccb2883d25220ffaf.poster.avif?t=1738157526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/1cea383520872ccccb2883d25220ffaf.webm?t=1738157526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394880/extras/1cea383520872ccccb2883d25220ffaf.mp4?t=1738157526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src